。\r\n　　喜欢上小明后 ，小四便像跌进一个无底深渊，开始被外界的各种力量牵着鼻子走。新识仰慕对象honey（林鸿铭）意外身亡，一向敬重的父亲的自尊与精神因为某次事件严重受损，加上将一次次“欺骗玩弄”他感情的小明“看透”，血气方刚又有很强道德感的小四终于走上犯罪的道路，期望用自己的刀结束事件的根源。但小四不知的是，他眼中的根源只是这条食物链中微不足道的一环。<\/p>","vod_play_from":"wsym3u8","vod_play_server":"no","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"4K$https:\/\/v13.wsyzym3u8.com\/202601\/01\/2KERJas8QN22\/video\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"","vod_down_server":"","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"4K电影"},{"vod_id":135588,"type_id":62,"type_id_1":1,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"花束般的恋爱4K","vod_sub":"她和他的恋爱花期(港),爱如花束 恋恋不忘,Hanataba mitaina koi o shita,We Made a Beautiful Bouquet,I Fell in Love Like A Flower Bouquet","vod_en":"huashubandelianai4K","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"H","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"剧情,爱情","vod_pic":"https:\/\/img1.wsyzy.org\/upload\/vod\/20260107-1\/82367ba16662fc55e7256e3f35aea014.jpg","vod_pic_thumb":"","vod_pic_slide":"","vod_pic_screenshot":"","vod_actor":"菅田将晖,有村架纯,细田佳央太,清原果耶,小田切让,押井守","vod_director":"土井裕泰","vod_writer":"坂元裕二","vod_behind":"","vod_blurb":"深夜的地铁站，因错过末班车让山音麦（菅田将晖 饰）和八谷绢（有村架纯 饰）两个年轻人不期而遇。他们相约前往附近的咖啡店，并且畅聊文学、电影和各自的爱好。令他们感到惊喜的是，两个人无论是习惯、爱好还是理","vod_remarks":"4K","vod_pubdate":"","vod_total":0,"vod_serial":"","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"日本","vod_lang":"日语","vod_year":"2021","vod_version":"","vod_state":"正片","vod_author":"豆瓣","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":0,"vod_hits_day":0,"vod_hits_week":0,"vod_hits_month":0,"vod_duration":"124分钟","vod_up":0,"vod_down":0,"vod_score":"8.6","vod_score_all":0,"vod_score_num":816106,"vod_time":"2026-01-07 15:25:04","vod_time_add":1767770704,"vod_time_hits":0,"vod_time_make":0,"vod_trysee":0,"vod_douban_id":34874432,"vod_douban_score":"8.6","vod_reurl":"","vod_rel_vod":"","vod_rel_art":"","vod_pwd":"","vod_pwd_url":"","vod_pwd_play":"","vod_pwd_play_url":"","vod_pwd_down":"","vod_pwd_down_url":"","vod_content":"<p>深夜的地铁站，因错过末班车让山音麦（菅田将晖 饰）和八谷绢（有村架纯 饰）两个年轻人不期而遇。他们相约前往附近的咖啡店，并且畅聊文学、电影和各自的爱好。令他们感到惊喜的是，两个人无论是习惯、爱好还是理念居然极其相似，仿佛就是另一个自己，因此他们对对方渐渐产生好感。在此之后，他们相约再次见面，顺理成章成为了情侣。大学毕业，步入社会，小麦和小绢痴心相守。只不过现实生活磨砺着年轻人的意志和爱情。小麦被迫暂时放弃自己绘画的梦想，成为一名上班族，日渐拮据的生活也让他们减弱了对理想生活的要求。\r\n　　不知不觉，曾经如此合拍的两个人渐行渐远，变成了最熟悉的陌生人……<\/p>","vod_play_from":"wsym3u8","vod_play_server":"no","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"4K$https:\/\/v13.wsyzym3u8.com\/202601\/01\/rT5mVnErU822\/video\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"","vod_down_server":"","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"4K电影"},{"vod_id":135587,"type_id":62,"type_id_1":1,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"花束般的恋爱国语4K","vod_sub":"她和他的恋爱花期(港),爱如花束 恋恋不忘,Hanataba mitaina koi o shita,We Made a Beautiful Bouquet,I Fell in Love Like A Flower Bouquet","vod_en":"huashubandelianaiguoyu4K","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"H","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"剧情,爱情","vod_pic":"https:\/\/img1.wsyzy.org\/upload\/vod\/20260107-1\/7ab9741fdbb93d86f5f2cad8a48496eb.jpg","vod_pic_thumb":"","vod_pic_slide":"","vod_pic_screenshot":"","vod_actor":"菅田将晖,有村架纯,细田佳央太,清原果耶,小田切让,押井守","vod_director":"土井裕泰","vod_writer":"坂元裕二","vod_behind":"","vod_blurb":"深夜的地铁站，因错过末班车让山音麦（菅田将晖 饰）和八谷绢（有村架纯 饰）两个年轻人不期而遇。他们相约前往附近的咖啡店，并且畅聊文学、电影和各自的爱好。令他们感到惊喜的是，两个人无论是习惯、爱好还是理","vod_remarks":"4K","vod_pubdate":"","vod_total":0,"vod_serial":"","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"日本","vod_lang":"日语","vod_year":"2021","vod_version":"","vod_state":"正片","vod_author":"豆瓣","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":0,"vod_hits_day":0,"vod_hits_week":0,"vod_hits_month":0,"vod_duration":"124分钟","vod_up":0,"vod_down":0,"vod_score":"8.6","vod_score_all":0,"vod_score_num":816105,"vod_time":"2026-01-07 15:24:35","vod_time_add":1767770675,"vod_